# What the image may contain (decision 0052): an allowlist, so a new
# file in the project root (a database, a backup, an .env variant) stays
# out of the image unless it's added here on purpose.
# Never in the image: .env*, any database, branding/, backups/, reports/,
# outbox/, node_modules. Those live on the host and are mounted or passed in.
*

!app/
!migrations/
!alembic.ini
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!frontend/

# Built inside the image, never copied in.
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist

# Belt and braces, in case one of these ever lands in an allowed folder.
**/.env*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.zip
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
